WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
A valid message can carry the wrong meaning.
SilentShift compares the business commitment with approved records before the destination accepts it.

00:08.000 --> 00:24.000
20 CASE is not an approved promise of 240 EA.
Transport and JSON checks can succeed. Without approved evidence, SilentShift cannot infer a CASE-to-EA conversion.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
Hold the order before it reaches the destination.
The critical contradiction stays quarantined with zero simulator receipts. An agent or reviewer cannot override that veto.

00:36.000 --> 00:53.000
The same incoming value can be legitimate.
An effective approved amendment authorizes 20 CASE. Current authority permits one delivery to the IRIS simulator.

00:53.000 --> 01:10.000
See similar history. Keep current authority.
The fourth read-only tool returns scored resolved cases and amendments. A past delivery cannot release a current critical order.

01:10.000 --> 01:26.000
Each model exchange belongs to its case.
Recorded native session 374: 4 actual provider exchanges, each with its own request and response. Policy retains release authority.

01:26.000 --> 01:41.000
Give an eligible hold a human next step.
Review lists real native Workflow tasks. The reviewer inspects current evidence; critical contradictions remain blocked.

01:41.000 --> 01:55.000
Approve with a reason. Preserve one receipt.
The actual approved review completed its native task and delivered once. Versions and idempotency protect repeated decisions.

01:55.000 --> 02:09.000
A ready file enters the same native production.
The custom inbound adapter claims a partner JSON file and sends it through the same investigation and deterministic policy.

02:09.000 --> 02:18.000
Delivery and retry stay tied to one case.
The file reached Destination once. A separate critical file stayed quarantined; acknowledgement recovery did not redispatch.

02:18.000 --> 02:30.000
Catch meaning before delivery.
Inspect the source and reproduce the build-154 workflow. Five synthetic final outcomes passed; the rule-only baseline also passed.
